# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 1. Start: e22_start.sav (~/fe8-chapsaves; mGBA, route_e21.keys
# after 60,394 ticks: Eirika's route final chapter, turn 1, a player-phase suspend; the real army).
# The title menu offers Resume Chapter; the suspend is past the preparations, so the game starts
# straight on the map (no preparation Save). Resume (writes the resumed state back), Eirika waits
# in place (a suspend save), the map menu on grey Eirika, Suspend, Yes (a suspend save).
# 3800 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu
000*198
001*2      # 1500: A, Resume Chapter
000*198
001*2      # 1700: A, resume (the map from 1,800 on the PC)
000*298
001*2      # 2000: A, select Eirika (under the cursor)
000*148
001*2      # 2150: A, her own tile: the action menu (Item, Supply, Wait)
000*148
040*2      # 2300: Up, wraps to Wait
000*148
001*2      # 2450: A, Wait (a suspend save)
000*198
001*2      # 2650: A on grey Eirika: the map menu
000*148
040*2      # 2800: Up, wraps to End
000*148
040*2      # 2950: Up, Suspend
000*148
001*2      # 3100: A, Suspend: 'Do you want to quit?'
000*248
001*2      # 3350: A, Yes (a suspend save)
000*448
